  128   \par
  129                 /       A)      THE DEC-SUPPLIED BOOTSTRAP FOR THIS DEVICE WAS SELFISHLY AND\par
  130                 /               EXPEDIENTLY WRITTEN TO GET UP OS/8 WITHOUT REGARD FOR THE CONSEQUENCES\par
  131                 /               TO OTHER SYSTEMS. CONTRADICTORY ATTEMPTS AT BOTH BREVITY AND FRILL\par
  132                 /               FEATURES YIELD A BOOTSTRAP FOR EITHER DRIVE ZERO OR ONE THAT ONLY\par
